# Settings / Profile UI building blocks

Normative detail lives in **docs** (not all contributors use Cursor): [docs/wallet/SETTINGS_LAYOUT.md](../../docs/wallet/SETTINGS_LAYOUT.md) → **Building blocks**.

## Do

- New Settings / Profile UI: import existing primitives (`SettingsCollapsibleSection`, `SettingsFormModal`, `form-controls.css`, `MoreActionsMenu`, `InfoTip`, `RefreshIconButton`, `EditIconButton`, `CopyIconButton`, `SettingsSubheading`, `SettingsActionRow`, `formatAssetAmount`, `shortEvmAddress`).
- Before finish: `pnpm check:settings-profile-ui` with the other frontend CI gates.

## Do not

- Invent a second kebab, copy-icon SVG, tip paragraph, or settings form modal under `src/components/settings/` or `src/components/profile/`.
- Put DM WalletBar or squad governance work in Settings/Profile without an explicit ask — those are separate surfaces.
